{"sectionId":"development/early","items":[{"id":"development--early-k001","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"수정은 정자와 난자의 융합으로 시작되며 포유류 난자에서는 피질과립 반응 등이 다정자 수정 방지에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k002","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"난할은 전체 배아 크기의 큰 증가 없이 세포 수를 늘리는 초기 분열이다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k003","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"포유류 배반포의 inner cell mass는 배아 본체에, trophectoderm은 태반의 일부에 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k004","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"낭배형성은 배엽과 몸의 기본 축을 형성한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k005","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"척삭은 신경관 형성 유도와 축성 패턴에 중요하다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k006","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"외배엽은 표피와 신경계, 중배엽은 근육·뼈·혈액·신장 및 생식계 일부, 내배엽은 소화관·호흡기 상피 및 간·췌장 등의 실질에 주로 기여한다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k007","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"신경능선은 말초신경계, 멜라닌세포, 부신수질 등 다양한 구조를 만든다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k008","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"세포 운명은 모계 결정인자, 유도 신호, 위치 정보, 전사 조절 및 후성유전 조절에 의해 정해진다.","kind":"body-derived","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k009","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"난할은 세포 수 증가와 개별 세포 크기 감소가 특징이다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k010","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"신경능선은 외배엽 유래다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k011","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"원구의 운명은 발생 계통에 따라 다르며 단순 절대 규칙으로 모든 종에 적용하지 않는다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]},{"id":"development--early-k012","sectionId":"development/early","unitId":"development","subject":"biology","text":"중배엽이다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["biology2e","anatomy2e"]}]}